hen does not loop.\r\n\r\nSo let the mp4 play through once, loop, play again...it's at the end of that loop where it fails to loop again.\r\n\r\nI originally came across this issue loading an HLS stream that did not include a subtitle track (I was told it did)...the MP4 shown is  just a quicker (shorter) was of reproducing the same issue.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/653664251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Ste-RH","id":46531149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTMxMTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46531149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH","html_url":"https://github.com/Ste-RH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ste-RH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3511899906,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM1MTE4OTk5MDY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/3511899906","actor":{"login":"google-oss-bot","id":26440463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDQwNDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26440463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-oss-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/google-oss-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googl